Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the National Institute of Mental Health and Neuro-Sciences, Bangalore Act, 2012 (38 of 2012);
(b)
"Director" means the Director of the Institute;
(c)
"Institute" means the National Institute of Mental Health and Neuro-Sciences, Bangalore;
(d)
"President" means the President of the Institute;
(e)
"section" means a section of the Act.
